{"absent":["Numeric values of DMA direction, DMA attribute, filesystem, filelock and trace enumeration constants beyond the bit positions and counts shown.","Full trace event field layouts, entry structures, probe registration and enablement mechanics.","Locking, concurrency, sleep and calling context rules for the helpers shown.","Behaviors of perf, printk, power, modules, DMA engine, debug and audit subsystems beyond trace display fragments.","Error handling for event allocation failure, buffer overflow and dropped records.","Meanings and recovery actions for fast commit snapshot errors and scan failure outcomes beyond their names."],"dossier":"D13","findings":[{"kind":"abi_constant","sids":["include/trace/events/dma.h::DMA_TRACE_MAX_ENTRIES"],"text":"DMA tracing keeps a bounded history whose maximum length is 128 entries."},{"kind":"abi_constant","sids":["include/trace/events/kyber.h::DOMAIN_LEN","include/trace/events/kyber.h::LATENCY_TYPE_LEN"],"text":"Kyber trace string fields have fixed capacities with domain names up to sixteen characters and latency type names up to eight characters."},{"kind":"abi_constant","sids":["include/trace/events/lock.h::LCB_F_SPIN","include/trace/events/lock.h::LCB_F_READ","include/trace/events/lock.h::LCB_F_WRITE","include/trace/events/lock.h::LCB_F_RT","include/trace/events/lock.h::LCB_F_PERCPU","include/trace/events/lock.h::LCB_F_MUTEX"],"text":"Lock contention trace classification uses six single bit flags in the low bits to distinguish spin, read, write, realtime, percpu and mutex wait kinds."},{"kind":"abi_constant","sids":["include/trace/events/landlock.h::TRACE_UNTRUSTED_STR_OUTPUT_SIZE","include/trace/events/landlock.h::TRACE_TRUNCATION_MARKER"],"text":"Landlock trace string output reserves one quarter of the sequence buffer as headroom and marks truncation with an ellipsis glyph."},{"kind":"invariant","sids":["include/trace/events/capability.h::_TRACE_CAPABILITY_H","include/trace/events/cgroup.h::TRACE_SYSTEM","include/tra